  "body": "### Description\r\n\r\nEnhancement request to support request-side hint for disabling url preview for Client-Server API's m.room.message (text or notice).\r\n\r\nMy use-case is the bot that periodically sends notifications to certain chat. While I want URL previews be generally available for this chat, I don't want these bot messages to show URL preview.\r\n\r\nI see it as smth like this:\r\n```json\r\n{\r\n  \"msgtype\": \"m.text\",\r\n  \"format\": \"org.matrix.custom.html\",\r\n  \"formatted_body\": \"<a href='...'>text</a>\",\r\n  \"body\": \"[md text](md link)\",\r\n  \"hints\": [\"m.hint.no_preview\"]\r\n}\r\n\r\n```\r\nor this\r\n```json\r\n{\r\n  \"msgtype\": \"m.text\",\r\n  \"format\": \"org.matrix.custom.html.no.preview\",\r\n  \"formatted_body\": \"<a href='...'>text</a>\",\r\n  \"body\": \"[md text](md link)\",\r\n}\r\n\r\n```\r\n\r\nIf I need to create issue somewhere else, please advise.\r\nThanks in advance.\r\n\r\n### Steps to reproduce\r\n\r\nN/A\r\n\r\n### Version information\r\n\r\nThe one currently deployed on public instance of matrix.org",
